TITLE High-Temperature Geothermal Brine Silica Scaling and Mixing
SOLUTION 1 Deep Reservoir Brine
    temp      180.0
    pH        6.8
    pe        -2.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    Na        42.0
    K         4.5
    Ca        1.8
    Cl        46.0
    S(6)      1.2
    C(4)      3.5
    Si        8.2

SOLUTION 2 Reinjection Condensate
    temp      70.0
    pH        7.4
    pe        4.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    Na        5.0
    Cl        5.0
    C(4)      0.5

MIX 1
    1 0.8
    2 0.2

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Quartz    0.0 10.0
    Calcite   0.0 5.0

KINETICS 1
    Quartz
        -m0     1.0
        -m      1.0
        -parms  2.4e-7 5.0
    -steps 10800 in 12 steps

END
